        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Feb–Feb 2026 polls show TISZA leading or near parity with Fidesz in some polls, with substantial cross-pollster variability, lowering confidence in a guaranteed 2/3 outcome."
